flowchart LR
    manifest[(master_manifest.sqlite<br/>TEST refs + split/runtime lineage)]
    shards[Input<br/>Phase 2 HDF5 shards<br/>Read-only pixel backend]
    phase4_outputs[Input<br/>Stage 4 split bundle<br/>+ runtime_normalization_artifacts]
    checkpoints[Input<br/>Phase 8 checkpoints<br/>validated by recipe hashes]
    recipe[Input<br/>Phase 9 signed ensemble recipe JSON]
    env[Input<br/>Inference / export / runtime normalization config]
    p10[Phase 10<br/>10_inference_ensemble.py<br/>Validate lineage + checkpoints<br/>run TEST inference + reporting]
    outputs[Output<br/>Metrics JSON + confusion matrix PNG<br/>Markdown / CSV / LaTeX / PDF reports<br/>optional visualizations + run_config]

    manifest -. read TEST rows<br/>+ lineage refs .-> p10
    shards -. load test pixels .-> p10
    phase4_outputs --> p10
    checkpoints --> p10
    recipe --> p10
    env --> p10
    p10 --> outputs
    p10 -. read only .-> manifest
